  "description": "Low-level, allocation-free primitives that fill genuine BCL gaps: Lemire FastMod/FastDiv, struct PRNGs (xoshiro/xoroshiro/SplitMix64/wyrand/PCG), span LEB128/zig-zag varint codec, integer digit-count/Log10, fast non-crypto GUID v4 / RFC 9562 big-endian v7, fused/specialized SIMD reductions (single-pass MinMax, overflow-checked sum), and guaranteed branch-free conditional select. Part of the Celerity family.",
